      "content": {
        "markdown": "*To schedule an appointment for you and your family, call Pacific Hills Dental in Omaha, NE, today at (402)330-2243.*\n\n\n# Your Home for Customized Care\n\nYou deserve dental care designed just for you. That’s why we take time to get to know you before we ever examine your smile. With extensive experience and advanced dental technology, we can design every treatment with your specific needs and preferences in mind.\n\n## Care for the Whole Family\n\nOur goal is to provide the high-quality dental care that every member of your family needs and deserves, all within a comfortable and welcoming environment.\n\nWhen it comes to your family’s smiles, excellent care means more than just high-tech, advanced treatment options. It also means visiting a team that’s dedicated to and experienced in ensuring every member of your family receives the personalized dental care that they need. From routine checkups and cleanings to bite analysis and treatment options designed specifically for children, we offer highly customizable treatments and services that exceed the expectations of patients of all ages.\n\n### Success Stories\n\nBefore\n\nAfter\n\nBefore\n\nAfter\n\nBefore\n\nAfter\n\n## Meet Our Doctor\n\n#### Dr. Tom St. Germain\n\nWith a background in science processes, Dr. Germain’s approach to gentle, custom dental treatment is driven by his attention to detail. As a Fellow of the Academy of General Dentistry and member of several other organizations, he’s spent decades honing his skill and precision creating quality, lifelike cosmetic and restorative treatments for all patients. With a dedication to helping others and volunteering his time to worthy causes, Dr. Germain also volunteers regularly with the Special Olympics!\n\n## Contact Us\n\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google [Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy) and [Terms of Service](https://policies.google.com/terms) apply.\n\n## Latest Blog Updates\n\n### Veneers Mean A Chance At A Smile Makeover\n\nWhat if we could use a single cosmetic treatment option to reshape teeth mask stains, and help improve the overall appearance of your smile? With porcelain veneers, we could potentially…\n\n### Help In One Visit With Bonding/Contouring\n\nDo you want to make improvements for your smile’s appearance, and in only a single visit? With dental bonding and contouring, we can mask imperfections and even correct serious concerns…\n\n### In-Office And At-Home Teeth Whitening Treatments\n\nTeeth whitening provides a way to remove teeth stains and ensure your smile can really shine. In fact, we offer two different options, an in-office and at-home treatment. In today’s…",
        "plain_text": "About Us Meet Our Dentists Meet the Team Services Family Dentistry Children’s Dentistry Checkups & Cleanings Bruxism & TMJ Cosmetic Dentistry Teeth-Whitening Bonding & Contouring Porcelain Veneers Clear Aligners Restorative Dentistry Tooth Fillings CEREC Crowns Root Canal Therapy Tooth Extraction Dental Bridges Dentures Dental Implants Dental Emergencies For Patients Financing Read Our Reviews Leave a Review Our Blog Contact Us About Us Meet Our Dentists Meet the Team Services Family Dentistry Children’s Dentistry Checkups & Cleanings Bruxism & TMJ Cosmetic Dentistry Teeth-Whitening Bonding & Contouring Porcelain Veneers Clear Aligners Restorative Dentistry Tooth Fillings CEREC Crowns Root Canal Therapy Tooth Extraction Dental Bridges Dentures Dental Implants Dental Emergencies For Patients Financing Read Our Reviews Leave a Review Our Blog Contact Us Call Us Today (402) 330-2243 Contact Us Request An Appointment Your Home for Customized Care You deserve dental care designed just for you. That’s why we take time to get to know you before we ever examine your smile. With extensive experience and advanced dental technology, we can design every treatment with your specific needs and preferences in mind. Smile Makeover With the right cosmetic dental treatment, we can design a custom smile makeover that does wonders for your smile’s health and appearance. Dental Implants Dental implants give your replacement teeth something they couldn’t get otherwise – the support of posts that mimic your healthy teeth roots. CEREC Restorations A dental crown can give your tooth most of its strength and integrity back. With CEREC, we can design and place your crown in just a single visit. Teeth Whitening Improving the color, shine, and healthy appearance of your smile can be simple with professional cosmetic teeth-whitening treatment. Bruxism & TMJs A custom-designed appliance may help you improve your bite function by comfortably addressing your bruxism and/or TMJ disorder. Dental Emergencies Have a dental emergency? Follow our tips to minimize it, and don’t hesitate to call our office and schedule a visit as soon as possible. Care for the Whole Family Our goal is to provide the high-quality dental care that every member of your family needs and deserves, all within a comfortable and welcoming environment. When it comes to your family’s smiles, excellent care means more than just high-tech, advanced treatment options. It also means visiting a team that’s dedicated to and experienced in ensuring every member of your family receives the personalized dental care that they need. From routine checkups and cleanings to bite analysis and treatment options designed specifically for children, we offer highly customizable treatments and services that exceed the expectations of patients of all ages. Success Stories Before After Before After Before After Meet Our Doctor Dr. Tom St. Germain With a background in science processes, Dr. Germain’s approach to gentle, custom dental treatment is driven by his attention to detail. As a Fellow of the Academy of General Dentistry and member of several other organizations, he’s spent decades honing his skill and precision creating quality, lifelike cosmetic and restorative treatments for all patients. With a dedication to helping others and volunteering his time to worthy causes, Dr. Germain also volunteers regularly with the Special Olympics! Contact Us This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. Latest Blog Updates Veneers Mean A Chance At A Smile Makeover What if we could use a single cosmetic treatment option to reshape teeth mask stains, and help improve the overall appearance of your smile? With porcelain veneers, we could potentially… Read More Help In One Visit With Bonding/Contouring Do you want to make improvements for your smile’s appearance, and in only a single visit? With dental bonding and contouring, we can mask imperfections and even correct serious concerns… Read More In-Office And At-Home Teeth Whitening Treatments Teeth whitening provides a way to remove teeth stains and ensure your smile can really shine. In fact, we offer two different options, an in-office and at-home treatment. In today’s… Read More © 2026 Pacific Hills Dental. Website Designed and Maintained by",
